	"name": "Maddening Spores",
	"type": "feature",
	"img": "icons/consumables/mushrooms/umbontae-bumpy-purple.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>You shake your shoulders, letting loose a cloud of pollen or spores with a nasty surprise. As an action, this cloud bursts out in a 5-foot radius centered on you. All creatures within the area of effect must succeed on a Constitution saving throw versus your maneuver DC or become confused until the start of your next turn. You may use this ability a number of times equal to your proficiency bonus per long rest.</p>",
